olamiento e integra consumidores.",{"_122":383},"platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx",{"_105":106,"_100":385,"_107":-7,"_108":-7,"_109":-7,"_111":-7,"_102":386,"_98":499,"_120":500,"_118":502},"<span><span>Actualizaciones</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-[3px] bg-[var(--lm-badge-bg)] px-1.5 py-px text-[0.58rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white ml-2 align-middle\">Enterprise</span></span>",[387,392,394,399,401,406,411,416,421,426,431,434,439,444,449,454,459,462,467,472,477,479,484,489,494],{"_98":388,"_105":115,"_100":72,"_109":389,"_118":-7,"_12":71,"_120":390},"es:platform/updates/overview.mdx","Qué hace el servicio, cómo encaja con Lamassu IoT, WFX y hawkBit, y por dónde empezar.",{"_122":391},"platform/updates/overview.mdx",{"_98":393,"_105":143,"_118":-7,"_100":144},"es:_7",{"_98":395,"_105":115,"_100":46,"_109":396,"_118":-7,"_12":45,"_120":397},"es:platform/updates/getting-started.mdx","Ejecuta Lamassu Updates y sus dependencias en local con Docker Compose y comprueba que la API responde.",{"_122":398},"platform/updates/getting-started.mdx",{"_98":400,"_105":143,"_118":-7,"_100":37},"es:_8",{"_98":402,"_105":115,"_100":37,"_109":403,"_118":-7,"_12":36,"_120":404},"es:platform/updates/concepts.mdx","Paquetes de actualización, módulos de software, campañas de lanzamiento, workflows y cómo llega una actualización a un dispositivo.",{"_122":405},"platform/updates/concepts.mdx",{"_98":407,"_105":115,"_100":33,"_109":408,"_118":-7,"_12":32,"_120":409},"es:platform/updates/architecture.mdx","Los componentes de Lamassu Updates, cómo se conectan en cada backend y qué se ejecuta en segundo plano.",{"_122":410},"platform/updates/architecture.mdx",{"_98":412,"_105":115,"_100":43,"_109":413,"_118":-7,"_12":42,"_120":414},"es:platform/updates/flows.mdx","Diagramas de secuencia de las operaciones importantes, para los backends nativo y hawkBit.",{"_122":415},"platform/updates/flows.mdx",{"_98":417,"_105":115,"_100":40,"_109":418,"_118":-7